h="4" height="12"/><Text color="#A9B8D0" fontSize="20" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="4" height="1.34">② 退款是利润的主要波动源。6 月与 8 月退款率升至 8.00%，经营利润率同步跌到 21.99% 与 23.72%；9 月退款率回到 4.00%，利润率恢复至 31.81%。</Text></Column></Positioned><Positioned left="1000" top="874" width="480" height="1"><Container width="480" height="1" color="#2B3E63"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1000" top="884" width="480" height="74"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START"><Text color="#34D399" fontSize="20" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">行动建议</Text><Container width="4" height="6"/><Text color="#34D399" fontSize="20" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="3" height="1.34">优先复核 6/8 月的退款动因并把退款率稳定在 5% 以内；停止单纯加投流量，把预算转向转化路径优化。</Text></Column></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="972" width="1504" height="22"><Container width="1504" height="22" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text color="#7A8AA6" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">口径：净收入 = gross_revenue − refund_amount；经营利润 = 净收入 − operating_cost；退款率 = refund_amount ÷ gross_revenue；转化率 = orders ÷ sessions。合计与 KPI 比例按期间汇总值加权计算。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>